<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PepsiCo EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PepsiCo EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it cut its 1997 earnings estimate on PepsiCo Inc by $0.06 a share to $1.47 a share.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed estimate because PaineWebber now projects slower recovery in international soft drinks for Pepsi.</p>
<p>-- said the 1998 earnings estimate is $1.70 a share.</p>
<p>-- said reiterates buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Pepsi lost 1/2 to 32-3/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
